      "content": "6. Monetary Policy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6wh2j4p",
      "content": "• Monetary policy refers to control of money supply by the central bank."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "o4bzkfk",
      "content": "• It aims to control inflation and promote economic growth."
    },
